  "content": "<html><body><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/kNytodv.png\" alt=\"YUNG&#x27;s Better Jungle Temples\" width=\"1344\" height=\"416\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/yungs-api\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://tinyurl.com/yungsapibadge\" alt=\"Depends on YUNG&#x27;s API\" width=\"211\" height=\"26\"></a>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://discord.gg/rns3beq\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://tinyurl.com/yungsdiscordbadge2\" alt=\"Join the YUNG GANG on Discord!\" width=\"136\" height=\"28\"></a>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://twitter.com/yungnickyoung\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://tinyurl.com/yungstwitterbadge3\" alt=\"Follow me on Twitter!\" width=\"76\" height=\"27\"></a>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCmEhjcMNhSDTRJgjVfbs9Rw\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://tinyurl.com/yungsyoutubebadge\" alt=\"Subscribe to my YouTube!\" width=\"80\" height=\"30\"></a>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://patreon.com/yungnickyoung\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://tinyurl.com/yungspatreonbadge\" alt=\"Support me on Patreon!\" width=\"138\" height=\"28\"></a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/ujP2J5g.png\" alt=\"What is this?\" width=\"1125\" height=\"59\"></p>\n<p><strong>Minecraft丛林神殿的完整升级！</strong> YUNG's Better Jungle Temples从基础重新设计了丛林神殿，拥有全新的设计、陷阱、谜题和宝藏！</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/ladFuIF.png\" alt=\"兼容性\" width=\"1125\" height=\"59\"></p>\n<p>YUNG's Better Jungle Temples内置了与许多模组的兼容性！如果您使用以下模组中的任何模组，神殿的一部分生成有机会使用特殊组件。注意这是一个可选功能——这些模组不是使用 Better Jungle Temples 的必要条件。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Create</li>\n<li>Supplementaries</li>\n<li>Alex's Mobs</li>\n</ul>\n<p>YUNG's Better Jungle Temples 旨在完全兼容所有世界生成模组，包括：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/yungs-better-ocean-monuments\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">YUNG's Better Ocean Monuments</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/yungs-better-nether